  "question": {
    "text": "Which of the following gives the molarity of a 17.0% by mass solution of sodium acetate, <math> <mrow> <msub> <mrow> <mtext>CH</mtext></mrow> <mtext>3</mtext> </msub> <mtext>COONa</mtext><mfenced> <mrow> <mtext>FM</mtext><mtext> </mtext><mtext>=</mtext><mtext> </mtext><mtext>82</mtext><mtext>.0</mtext><mtext> </mtext><mtext>amu</mtext></mrow> </mfenced></mrow> </math> in water? Given the density is <math> <mrow> <mtext>1</mtext><mtext>.09</mtext><mtext> </mtext><mtext>g/mol</mtext></mrow> </math>."
